          "from": "PIE *nókʷts 'night'",
          "to": "Proto-Germanic *nahts > Gothic 𐌽𐌰𐌷𐍄𐍃 nahts",
          "note": "PIE short *o merged with *a in Proto-Germanic."
        }
      ]
    },
